# 2.11. Sequence Diagram (PlantUML) – các luồng chính

> Ghi chú: Các endpoint/luồng dưới đây bám theo code hiện có trong dự án (API Gateway `services/api_gateway/gateway/middleware.py`, templates JS ở `services/api_gateway/templates/*`, và các microservice trong `services/*`).

---

## 1) Luồng xem sản phẩm và Thêm vào giỏ hàng (Product View & Cart Flow)

@startuml
actor User
participant "Browser\n(product_detail.html + base.html JS)" as Browser
participant "API Gateway\n(gateway.views + RoutingMiddleware)" as Gateway
participant "Product Service\nproduct_app.views" as ProdSvc
participant "Tracking Service\ntracking_app.views" as TrackSvc
participant "Cart Service\ncart_app.views" as CartSvc
participant "Recommendation Service\nFastAPI main.py" as RecoSvc
database "Tracking DB" as TrackDB
database "Cart DB" as CartDB
database "Qdrant" as Qdrant

== Open product detail page ==
User -> Browser: open /product/detail/{product_id}/
Browser -> Gateway: GET /product/detail/{product_id}/\n(render product_detail.html)
Gateway --> Browser: 200 HTML

== Load product detail from Product Service ==
Browser -> Gateway: GET /api/products/{product_id}/
activate Gateway
Gateway -> ProdSvc: forward GET /api/products/{product_id}/
activate ProdSvc
ProdSvc --> Gateway: 200 JSON Product.to_dict()
deactivate ProdSvc
Gateway --> Browser: 200 JSON
deactivate Gateway

== Tracking: product view ==
Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/tracking/log-view/\nbody: {customer_id, product_id, product_type}
Gateway -> TrackSvc: forward POST /api/tracking/log-view/
activate TrackSvc
TrackSvc -> TrackDB: INSERT product_views
TrackSvc --> Gateway: 201 {success:true}
deactivate TrackSvc
Gateway --> Browser: 201

== AI Chatbot trigger (view) ==
Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/chatbot/ask\nbody:{user_id, trigger:'view', product_id, message:''}
Gateway --> Browser: 200 {success:true, reply, recommendations}

== Add to cart from product detail ==
User -> Browser: click "Add to Shopping Bag"
Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/cart/add/\nAuthorization: Bearer ...\nbody:{product_type, product_id, quantity, price, product_name, image_url}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> CartSvc: forward POST /api/cart/add/
activate CartSvc
CartSvc -> CartDB: get_or_create Cart(customer_id)\nget_or_create CartItem(...)\nupdate quantity/price
CartSvc --> Gateway: 200/201 {success:true, data:cart.to_dict()}
deactivate CartSvc
Gateway --> Browser: 200/201
deactivate Gateway

== Tracking: cart action ==
Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/tracking/log-cart/\nbody:{customer_id, product_id, product_type, action_type:'add', quantity, price}
Gateway -> TrackSvc: forward POST /api/tracking/log-cart/
activate TrackSvc
TrackSvc -> TrackDB: INSERT cart_actions
TrackSvc --> Gateway: 201 {success:true}
deactivate TrackSvc
Gateway --> Browser: 201

== Refresh recommendations on homepage / badge update ==
Browser -> Gateway: GET /api/cart/\nAuthorization: Bearer ...
Gateway -> CartSvc: forward GET /api/cart/
CartSvc --> Gateway: 200 {success:true, data:cart.to_dict()}
Gateway --> Browser: 200

Browser -> Gateway: GET /api/recommendations/{user_id}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> RecoSvc: forward GET /api/recommendations/{user_id}
activate RecoSvc
RecoSvc -> TrackSvc: GET /api/tracking/user-history/{user_id}/
TrackSvc -> TrackDB: SELECT recent views/carts/purchases/searches
TrackSvc --> RecoSvc: 200 history
RecoSvc -> Qdrant: retrieve(ids=user_actions)\nsearch(similarity, limit)
RecoSvc --> Gateway: 200 {success:true, recommendations:[...]}
deactivate RecoSvc
Gateway --> Browser: 200 JSON
deactivate Gateway

Browser --> User: show toast + update cart badge + render recs
@enduml

---

## 2) Luồng mua sắm và Thanh toán (Purchase & Checkout Flow)

@startuml
actor User
participant "Browser\n(checkout.html JS)" as Browser
participant "API Gateway\nRoutingMiddleware" as Gateway
participant "Customer Service" as CustSvc
participant "Cart Service" as CartSvc
participant "Voucher Service" as VoucherSvc
participant "Order Service\norder_app.views.place_order" as OrderSvc
participant "Product Service\nproduct_app.views.update_stock" as ProdSvc
participant "Tracking Service\ntracking_app.views.LogPurchaseView" as TrackSvc
database "Order DB\n(orders, order_items)" as OrderDB
database "Cart DB\n(carts, cart_items)" as CartDB

== Open checkout ==
User -> Browser: open /checkout/
Browser -> Gateway: GET /checkout/\n(render checkout.html)
Gateway --> Browser: 200 HTML

== Init checkout page ==
Browser -> Gateway: GET /api/customer/address/\nAuthorization: Bearer ...
Gateway -> CustSvc: forward GET /api/customer/address/
CustSvc --> Gateway: 200 {success:true, data:[...]}
Gateway --> Browser: 200

Browser -> Gateway: GET /api/cart/\nAuthorization: Bearer ...
Gateway -> CartSvc: forward GET /api/cart/
CartSvc -> CartDB: get_or_create Cart(customer_id)\nSELECT items
CartSvc --> Gateway: 200 {success:true, data:cart.to_dict()}
Gateway --> Browser: 200

opt Apply voucher (UI)
  Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/vouchers/validate/\nAuthorization: Bearer ...\nbody:{code, order_amount}
  Gateway -> VoucherSvc: forward POST /api/vouchers/validate/
  VoucherSvc --> Gateway: 200/400 {success, data/error}
  Gateway --> Browser: 200/400
end

== Place order ==
User -> Browser: click "Place Order Now"
Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/orders/place/\nAuthorization: Bearer ...\nbody:{address_id, payment_method, voucher_code}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> OrderSvc: forward POST /api/orders/place/
activate OrderSvc

OrderSvc -> CartSvc: GET /api/cart/\n(Authorization forwarded)
CartSvc -> CartDB: SELECT cart + items
CartSvc --> OrderSvc: 200 cart_json

OrderSvc -> CustSvc: GET /api/customer/address/\n(Authorization forwarded)
CustSvc --> OrderSvc: 200 addresses

opt Voucher code provided
  OrderSvc -> VoucherSvc: POST /api/vouchers/validate/\n(Authorization forwarded)
  VoucherSvc --> OrderSvc: 200 voucher_data
end

OrderSvc -> OrderDB: INSERT orders\nINSERT order_items (transaction)

loop Each cart item
  OrderSvc -> ProdSvc: POST /api/products/update-stock/\nbody:{variant_id: item.product_id, quantity: -item.quantity}
  ProdSvc --> OrderSvc: 200 {success:true/false}
end

OrderSvc -> TrackSvc: POST /api/tracking/log-purchase/\nbody:{customer_id, order_id, items:[...]}
TrackSvc --> OrderSvc: 201 {success:true}

OrderSvc -> CartSvc: DELETE /api/cart/clear/\n(Authorization forwarded)
CartSvc -> CartDB: DELETE cart_items by cart
CartSvc --> OrderSvc: 200 {success:true}

OrderSvc --> Gateway: 201 {success:true, data:order.to_dict()}
deactivate OrderSvc
Gateway --> Browser: 201
deactivate Gateway

Browser --> User: redirect /orders/?success=true
@enduml

---

## 3) Hệ thống tư vấn thông minh (AI Chatbot Flow)

@startuml
actor User
participant "Browser\n(base.html JS triggerAI)" as Browser
participant "API Gateway\nRoutingMiddleware" as Gateway
participant "Chatbot Service\nFastAPI /api/chatbot/ask" as ChatSvc
database "Neo4j\n(KBClient)" as Neo4j
participant "AI Engine\n(LSTM predict_next_product)" as AIEngine
participant "FreeLLM API\n(apifreellm.com)" as FreeLLM
participant "Local Brain\n(fallback)" as LocalBrain

== Trigger chatbot (chat/view/cart/search) ==
User -> Browser: open chat / send message / implicit trigger
Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/chatbot/ask\nbody:{user_id, message, trigger, product_id?}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> ChatSvc: forward POST /api/chatbot/ask
activate ChatSvc

opt record action when trigger in {view, cart, search} and product_id present
  ChatSvc -> Neo4j: MERGE (User)\nMATCH (Product)\nMERGE (u)-[:VIEWED|:SEARCHED|:ADDED_TO_CART]->(p)
end

ChatSvc -> Neo4j: get_user_history(user_id)\n(last actions)
Neo4j --> ChatSvc: history[]

opt buying/search intent detected (keyword-based)
  ChatSvc -> Neo4j: search_products(keyword, limit=5)\n(or get_top_rated_products)
  Neo4j --> ChatSvc: products[]
else use AI-based recommendation
  ChatSvc -> AIEngine: predict_next_product(actions, product_ids)
  AIEngine --> ChatSvc: top_3 ids
  ChatSvc -> Neo4j: get_product_details(top_3)\nget_top_rated_products()\nget_active_vouchers()
  Neo4j --> ChatSvc: details + top + vouchers
end

opt FREELLM_API_KEY configured
  ChatSvc -> FreeLLM: POST /api/v1/chat\n(prompt includes context)
  FreeLLM --> ChatSvc: 200 response
else
  ChatSvc -> LocalBrain: synthesize(message, context, trigger)
  LocalBrain --> ChatSvc: response
end

ChatSvc --> Gateway: 200 {success:true, reply, recommendations}
deactivate ChatSvc
Gateway --> Browser: 200 JSON
deactivate Gateway

Browser --> User: render bot reply + clickable recommendations
@enduml

---

## 4) Theo dõi hành vi và Gợi ý (Behavior Tracking Flow)

@startuml
actor User
participant "Browser\n(homepage.html/product_detail.html JS)" as Browser
participant "API Gateway\nRoutingMiddleware" as Gateway
participant "Tracking Service\ntracking_app.views" as TrackSvc
participant "Order Service\norder_app.views.place_order" as OrderSvc
participant "Recommendation Service\nFastAPI main.py" as RecoSvc
database "Tracking DB" as TrackDB
database "Qdrant" as Qdrant
participant "Product Service" as ProdSvc

== Behavior events ==
opt Search event (when implemented by UI)
  Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/tracking/log-search/\nbody:{customer_id, query}
  Gateway -> TrackSvc: forward POST /api/tracking/log-search/
  TrackSvc -> TrackDB: INSERT search_history
  TrackSvc --> Gateway: 201 {success:true}
  Gateway --> Browser: 201
end

Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/tracking/log-view/\nbody:{customer_id, product_id, product_type}
Gateway -> TrackSvc: forward POST /api/tracking/log-view/
TrackSvc -> TrackDB: INSERT product_views
TrackSvc --> Gateway: 201
Gateway --> Browser: 201

Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/tracking/log-cart/\nbody:{customer_id, product_id, product_type, action_type, quantity, price}
Gateway -> TrackSvc: forward POST /api/tracking/log-cart/
TrackSvc -> TrackDB: INSERT cart_actions
TrackSvc --> Gateway: 201
Gateway --> Browser: 201

== Purchase event from Order Service ==
OrderSvc -> TrackSvc: POST /api/tracking/log-purchase/\nbody:{customer_id, order_id, items:[...]}
TrackSvc -> TrackDB: INSERT purchase_actions (per item)
TrackSvc --> OrderSvc: 201 {success:true}

== Generate recommendations ==
User -> Browser: open homepage (logged-in)
Browser -> Gateway: GET /api/recommendations/{user_id}
Gateway -> RecoSvc: forward GET /api/recommendations/{user_id}
RecoSvc -> TrackSvc: GET /api/tracking/user-history/{user_id}/
TrackSvc -> TrackDB: SELECT recent events
TrackSvc --> RecoSvc: 200 history
RecoSvc -> Qdrant: retrieve(payloads)\nsearch(similarity)
alt Qdrant/Tracking failure
  RecoSvc -> ProdSvc: GET /api/products/\n(fallback products)
  ProdSvc --> RecoSvc: 200 products[]
end
RecoSvc --> Gateway: 200 recommendations[]
Gateway --> Browser: 200
Browser --> User: render "Recommended For You"
@enduml

---

## 5) Quản lý Đánh giá và Bình luận (Product Review Flow)

@startuml
actor User
participant "Browser\n(orders.html JS)" as Browser
participant "API Gateway\nRoutingMiddleware" as Gateway
participant "Order Service\norder_app.views.get_order_detail" as OrderSvc
participant "Rating Service\nrating_app.views" as RatingSvc
database "Rating DB\n(ratings)" as RatingDB

== Load orders ==
User -> Browser: open /orders/
Browser -> Gateway: GET /orders/\n(render orders.html)
Gateway --> Browser: 200 HTML

Browser -> Gateway: GET /api/orders/mine/\nAuthorization: Bearer ...
Gateway -> OrderSvc: forward GET /api/orders/mine/
OrderSvc --> Gateway: 200 {success:true, data:[orders...]}
Gateway --> Browser: 200

== Check which items are already rated ==
loop each delivered order
  Browser -> Gateway: GET /api/ratings/order/{order_id}/\nAuthorization: Bearer ...
  Gateway -> RatingSvc: forward GET /api/ratings/order/{order_id}/
  RatingSvc --> Gateway: 200 {success:true, data:[ratings...]}
  Gateway --> Browser: 200
end

== Submit rating (includes comment) ==
User -> Browser: click ⭐ Rate -> Submit
Browser -> Gateway: POST /api/ratings/add/\nAuthorization: Bearer ...\nbody:{order_id, product_type, product_id, product_name, stars, comment}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> RatingSvc: forward POST /api/ratings/add/
activate RatingSvc

RatingSvc -> OrderSvc: GET /api/orders/{order_id}/\nAuthorization: Bearer ...\n(verify delivered + owner + item exists)
OrderSvc --> RatingSvc: 200 {success:true, data:order}

RatingSvc -> RatingDB: check unique(order_id, product_type, product_id)\nINSERT ratings
RatingSvc --> Gateway: 200 {success:true, data:rating.to_dict()}
deactivate RatingSvc
Gateway --> Browser: 200
deactivate Gateway

Browser --> User: update UI "Rated ✅"
@enduml

